{
 "id": "verse-55-1-7-jazz",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/verse-55-1-7-jazz",
 "offset_seconds": -2.9800000000001923,
 "words_heard": 239,
 "words": 247,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Recalling your tears, I long to see you",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So that I may be filled with joy",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Reminded of your sincere faith",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Lived first in your grandmother Lois",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your mother Eunice, I am convinced",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It lives in you as well",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "That is why I remind you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To fan into flame the gift of God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "That is in you through the laying on",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of my hands upon your head",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For God did not give us a spirit of timidity",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But of power and love and self-control",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So do not be ashamed of the testimony",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "About our Lord, or of me his prisoner",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Instead, share in suffering for the gospel",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "By the power of God who saved us",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And called us with a holy calling",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Not because of our works, but his own",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Purpose and grace, given in Christ Jesus",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before time began, now revealed",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For God did not give us a spirit of timidity",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But of power and love and self-control",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So do not be ashamed of the testimony",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "About our Lord, or of me his prisoner",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through the appearing of our Savior Jesus Christ",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who abolished death and brought life to light",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And immortality through the gospel",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now made clear to our eyes",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For God did not give us a spirit of timidity",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
